3
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:05,680
A developer tried to read computer

4
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:06,400
data from it.

5
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,880
Weber Kai examined an online

6
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:11,280
recording he identified as an episode

7
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:12,880
of the Brazilian show Clip

8
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:13,760
Informática.

9
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:16,320
He extracted the relevant sound and

10
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:18,080
published instructions for reading it

11
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:18,880
with a decoder.

12
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:21,280
Those instructions describe six

13
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,360
